<title>POLAND: JUTRZENKA SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>JUTRZENKA SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.38 vs   1.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.41 vs   1.67</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.52 vs   1.74</p>
<p> Sales		   12.99 vs   8.17</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.29 vs   6.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	11.67 vs   8.47</p>
<p> Operating profit    12.83 vs   8.47</p>
<p> Sales		   88.58 vs  58.28</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectionery is Jutrzenka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
